+	 * defined with the *top* screen's width (400, not 320), so the Device
+	 * mapping ran 288000 bytes from 0x18119400 and covered not just all of
+	 * fb1 but the start of FB_BOT_2 as well.
+	 *
+	 * Nothing consumes the mapping: the whole nintendo3ds_bottom_lcd_draw_*
+	 * API it exists to serve has no callers left anywhere in the tree
+	 * (fbtest was retired, and Android draws through fb1). bottom_lcd.c is
+	 * kept as-is so those helpers stay available -- but whatever revives
+	 * them must map fb1 write-combining to match simplefb rather than with
+	 * plain ioremap(), and must fix FB_BOT_SIZE first.
